#: src/uagent/web.py:926
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"## Generative UI (Artifacts) Instructions\n"
"When the user asks for a UI, dashboard, interactive tool, or "
"visualization:\n"
"1. Write a complete, self-contained HTML page inside a single ```html "
"code block.\n"
"2. Use Tailwind CSS (via CDN: <script "
"src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>) for styling and Lucide "
"Icons or FontAwesome for icons.\n"
"3. Include interactive JavaScript (e.g., Chart.js for charts, or simple "
"state management).\n"
"4. Do not split the code into multiple blocks; keep it in one unified "
"```html block.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"## Generative UI (Artifacts) Instruksjoner\n"
"Når brukeren ber om et brukergrensesnitt, dashbord, interaktivt verktøy "
"eller visualisering:\n"
"1. Skriv en komplett, selvstendig HTML-side i en enkelt ```html-"
"kodeblokk.\n"
"2. Bruk Tailwind CSS (via CDN: <script "
"src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>) for styling og Lucide "
"Icons or FontAwesome for ikoner.\n"
"3. Inkluder interaktiv JavaScript (f.eks. Chart.js for diagrammer, eller "
"enkel tilstandsbehandling).\n"
"4. Ikke del koden opp i flere blokker; hold den i en enkelt forent "
"```html-blokk.\n"

